** Hron-Turek FSI3 plate: St Venant-Kirchhoff (*ELASTIC + NLGEOM), plane strain via u_z = 0
** Time integration: HHT with ALPHA = -0.3333 (the strongest CalculiX allows; the corrected sequence uses -0.05, see README)
*INCLUDE, INPUT=mesh.inp
*MATERIAL, NAME=SVK
*ELASTIC
 5.6E6, 0.4
*DENSITY
 1000.
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Eall, MATERIAL=SVK
*STEP, NLGEOM, INC=1000000
*DYNAMIC, DIRECT, ALPHA=-0.3333
 @DT@, 4.
*BOUNDARY
Nfix, 1, 3
*BOUNDARY
Nall, 3
*CLOAD
 Nsurface, 1, 0.0
 Nsurface, 2, 0.0
 Nsurface, 3, 0.0
*NODE FILE, FREQUENCY=200
 U
*END STEP
